Commit 4a49f92f9b:

fix(arrangement): draw the negative-offset clip where it plays (#2847)

### 🎯 What does this PR do?
Both renderers draw the pre-roll a negative-offset clip plays, via one
shared law.

### 🧪 How to test
Offset -1 at 120 BPM shows the silent gap then the first 1.5s. 61/61
specs.

### 🖼️ Screenshots
None.

### 📌 Related tickets & additional notes
Closes #2519

