pnpm test:run on syncopatedArpeggioPromptWorkflow and
bassProcessingCopyPromptWorkflow: both walk to confirmation, execution,
receipt, undo and redo without either spec being edited. The new
composeVerifiedProviderProposalScope spec proves ranges come from
compiled commands on both branches, with one named failure per restored
hand-mirror mutation. Nine adjacent workflow and strategy specs stay
green; typecheck and typecheck:test pass.

