Pending-effect continuation part of a bigger PR, four files. Adversarial review please, read the lifecycle code around it before you sign off.

Commit cf063d9f1f (diff trimmed to the part I care about):

fix(ai): harden retained render settlement (#3112)

### 🎯 What does this PR do?
Adds an exact, batch-bound review flow for retained section renders so
users can preview and export the original buffers, then accept, discard,
or acknowledge missing evidence without replaying project commands. The
durable disposition remains distinct from external-effect completion,
and stale, ambiguous, or later-revision artifacts fail closed.

### 🧪 How to test
Trigger a section render that completes with a review-required warning.
In AI Chat, verify each retained section can be played and exported as
WAV, then accept or discard the whole receipt-bound review. If the
retained buffer has expired, verify the card offers an
unavailable-evidence acknowledgement instead. No action should rerender
or change the project.

### 🖼️ Screenshots
None.

### 📌 Related tickets & additional notes
Closes #2990

